## Why This Is Asked
This evaluates practical design skills for privacy-preserving NLP systems, edge computing constraints, and multilingual text processing in real-world chat applications.

## Key Concepts
- Hybrid PII detection using regex rules and ML classification
- On-device inference with strict latency requirements (<150ms)
- Multilingual support and code-switching handling
- Configurable redaction policies and comprehensive audit logging
- Evaluation methodology combining offline metrics and staged rollout
- Automated rollback strategies for production safety

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode for multilingual PII redaction
function redactPII(text, language = 'auto') {
  const tokens = tokenizeMultilingual(text);
  const regexMatches = applyRegexRules(tokens);
  const mlPredictions = classifyContext(tokens, language);
  return mergeAndRedact(text, regexMatches, mlPredictions);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you balance false positives versus coverage in PII redaction?
- How would you monitor and maintain model performance across languages?
- What fallback mechanisms would you implement for edge cases?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design practical, on-device NLP that yields actionable summaries from multilingual consumer reviews, a realistic Instacart/Amazon use case, without network dependency.

## Key Concepts
- On-device multilang NLP under tight size constraints
- Feature extraction via lightweight POS or rules
- Sentiment aggregation and justification
- Privacy-first data labeling and offline evaluation

## Code Example
```javascript
function scoreFeature(feature, sentences) {
  let score = 0;
  for (const s of sentences) {
    if (s.toLowerCase().includes(feature)) {
      if (/\b(good|great|excellent|loved)\b/.test(s)) score += 1;
      if (/\b(bad|worst|terrible|hate)\b/.test(s)) score -= 1;
    }
  }
  return score;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you handle negation and language switch within a single sentence?
- How would you validate usefulness of summaries to buyers?

